  "description": {
   "en": "Even the comrades he's shared good times and bad times with look down on and make fun of him. Lore, who's been treated like a useless nobody meets a wise and sagacious merchant, Coraldo. Coraldo sees potential and a hidden talent in Lore. Together with the mystical animals that are devoted to Lore and a group of foreign adventurers, Lore begins a new journey.",
